# Student Dashboard

Auth: only authenticated students. Brand: Primary Text `#111827` + palette surfaces (canvas `#F7F8FA`, cards `#FFFFFF`).
Sticky header (shadcn): logo + search | theme toggle + notifications dialog + profile dropdown.
No mentor section, Follow buttons, Recent Certificates, or See All / View All on dashboard.

## Sidebar nav (order)

Dashboard · My Courses · Feedback & Discussions · Resources · Certificates · Orders · Technical Support · Notifications · Profile · Logout

## Pages

1. **Dashboard** — cards (active/completed courses, certificates, quiz avg); Welcome; Continue Learning; Learning Progress; Learning Streak; Upcoming Quizzes; Recent Notifications; Recent Certificates
2. **My Courses** — search, cards (thumbnail, title, instructor, progress, Continue → Learning Page)
3. **Learning Page** — from Dashboard/My Courses only; header (back, notifications, theme, mark complete); left curriculum; center video + tabs (Description / Quiz / Assignment)
4. **Feedback & Discussions** — assignment feedback thread; statuses: Submitted, Reviewed, Passed, Failed
5. **Resources** — search/download PDF, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, ZIP
6. **Certificates** — request, status (Pending/Approved/Ready/Rejected), download, verify
7. **Orders** — invoices, payment method, transaction id, status
8. **Technical Support** — tickets Open/Pending/Replied/Closed; image upload
9. **Notifications** — mark read/delete; types: course, assignment, quiz, cert, payment, announcements
10. **Profile** — edit avatar, name, phone, bio; email/reg date/status read-only; password via Forgot Password only

## Workflow

Register → Login → Dashboard → Purchase → Activated → Continue Learning → Watch → Quiz/Assignment → Mark Complete → … → Request Certificate → Download
